@page "/"

<PageTitle>About</PageTitle>

<h1>Usage Instructions</h1>

<ul>
    <li><h3>Entering a value</h3><p>Click on your desired cell and then input in the highlighted text field and either press enter or click on another cell.</p></li>
    <li><h3>Saving</h3><p>Press the save button and a file will with the data will automatically be downloaded to your system.</p></li>
    <li><h3>Loading</h3><p>Will load a .sprd file into the spreadsheet.</p></li>
    <li><h3>Toggle dark mode</h3><p>Press the toggle visuals button to toggle dark mode.</p></li>
    <li><h3>Resetting</h3><p>To reset the spreadsheet, either refresh the page or click on the about me and back to the spreadsheet.</p></li>
</ul>

